alse, "text": "what it buys and what it costs", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "what it buys and what it costs", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.2}, {"id": "b_to2", "type": "rectangle", "x": 915, "y": 740, "width": 450, "height": 110, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "aJ", "roundness": null, "seed": 1464442376, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 959836280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "IGujxxlUeXf33cH3s5tva"}], "updated": 1785874469208, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "b_punch", "type": "text", "x": 400, "y": 910, "width": 496.50390625, "height": 52.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "aK", "roundness": null, "seed": 1378690680, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 297366280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1785874469208, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The difference is not overwrite versus preserve.\nIt is server inference versus author intent.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "The difference is not overwrite versus preserve.\nIt is server inference versus author intent.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.2}, {"id": "842dqJNEtYVTo0jd3nrX6", "type": "text", "x": 406.873046875, "y": 284.8, "width": 206.25390625, "height": 50.400000000000006, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "aL", "roundness": null, "seed": 386998648, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 2067671416, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1785874469238, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "remember(...)\nraw evidence is staged before\nit is promoted to a typed fact", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "b_dm_write", "originalText": "remember(...)\nraw evidence is staged before\nit is promoted to a typed fact", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.2}, {"id": "ntzFC8bYgUZDuSlMnffR3", "type": "text", "x": 407.46435546875, "y": 434.8, "width": 205.0712890625, "height": 50.400000000000006, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "aM", "roundness": null, "seed": 1415459448, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 2116897288, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1785874469238, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "the server compares claims\na comparable conflict becomes\na clarification task", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "b_dm_store", "originalText": "the server compares claims\na comparable conflict becomes\na clarification task", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.2}, {"id": "GYbU8h8r1oXCD52jkFh6O", "type": "text", "x": 406.640625, "y": 584.8, "width": 206.71875, "height": 50.400000000000006, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "aN", "roundness": null, "seed": 1742807928, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1034566264, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1785874469238, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "recall_memory(...)\nsupport-gated: candidates and\nhypotheses stay out by default", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "b_dm_recall", "originalText": "recall_memory(...)\nsupport-gated: candidates and\nhypotheses stay out by default", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.2}, {"id": "PSFjec4hrfER0PJzWjMx4", "type": "text", "x": 1036.53125, "y": 284.8, "width": 206.9375, "height": 50.400000000000006, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "aO", "roundness": null, "seed": 1339946104, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1963378952, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1785874469238, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "memory_supersede(parent_id, ...)\nthe author names what this\nversion replaces", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "b_n_write", "originalText": "memory_supersede(parent_id, ...)\nthe author names what this\nversion replaces", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.2}, {"id": "AmWS7jHUeIMXSldVnlnzp", "type": "text", "x": 1023.720703125, "y": 434.8, "width": 232.55859375, "height": 50.400000000000006, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "aP", "roundness": null, "seed": 572040568, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1517038456, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1785874469238, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "INSERT row + INSERT supersession\nthe server compares nothing\nand infers nothing", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "b_n_store", "originalText": "INSERT row + INSERT supersession\nthe server compares nothing\nand infers nothing", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.2}, {"id": "7HOtsZcV7ICoNL9S9chX_", "type": "text", "x": 1011.65185546875, "y": 593.2, "width": 256.6962890625, "height": 33.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "aQ", "roundness": null, "seed": 466957944, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1918396424, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1785874469238, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "memory_search  ->  the tip only\nmemory_get     ->  the whole chain", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "b_n_recall", "originalText": "memory_search  ->  the tip only\nmemory_get     ->  the whole chain", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.2}, {"id": "Iw4rogTY5iSX3zNlCOeNn", "type": "text", "x": 385.28759765625, "y": 763.8, "width": 249.4248046875, "height": 62.4, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "aR", "roundness": null, "seed": 836216696, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1271397496, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1785874469238, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Catches contradictions nobody noticed.\n\nPays for it with false positives and\na queue someone has to work through.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "b_to1", "originalText": "Catches contradictions nobody noticed.\n\nPays for it with false positives and\na queue someone has to work through.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.2}, {"id": "IGujxxlUeXf33cH3s5tva", "type": "text", "x": 1018.02978515625, "y": 763.8, "width": 243.9404296875, "height": 62.4, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "aS", "roundness": null, "seed": 543422584, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 840836872, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1785874469238, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "No queue, no false positives, no noise.\n\nPays for it when nobody marks the\ncontradiction: then nobody sees it.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "b_to2", "originalText": "No queue, no false positives, no noise.\n\nPays for it when nobody marks the\ncontradiction: then nobody sees it.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.2}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_900000", "x": 510, "y": 360, "width": 0, "height": 50, "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 900000, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 900001, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0, 50]], "startBinding": {"elementId": "b_dm_write", "focus": 0, "gap": 4}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "b_dm_store", "focus": 0, "gap": 4}, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_900010", "x": 510, "y": 510, "width": 0, "height": 50, "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 900010, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 900011, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0, 50]], "startBinding": {"elementId": "b_dm_store", "focus": 0, "gap": 4}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "b_dm_recall", "focus": 0, "gap": 4}, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_900020", "x": 1140, "y": 360, "width": 0, "height": 50, "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundCol